    "content": {
     "content": "## SF10X v-next.5 - Outreach Export\nExports SF10 drafts with status=audited + audit_result=pass to the Outreach Drafts Sheet tab (export-once on export_key). Re-ingests Outreach Control and re-checks suppression + freshness (approval <=14d, evidence <=30d) at export time; stale drafts are marked expired, never exported. Burmese drafts need sign-off until 10 have been exported.",
     "position": [
      -1200,
      40
